          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="content">
          <article class="image-card" aria-labelledby="image-title">
            <div class="image-frame">
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516900557549-41557e4e2a53?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80"
                alt="A modern desk setup with a laptop, notebook, and coffee mug near a bright window"
              />
            </div>

            <div class="image-meta">
              <dl>
                <dt id="image-title">Workspace mockup</dt>
                <dd>Uploaded 2 days ago · 4.8 MB</dd>
              </dl>

              <p class="delete-note">Deleting removes the image from your library only.</p>
            </div>

